---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy policy | Gea Studio"
	description="Gea Studio's privacy policy. Information about processing personal data when you contact us by phone or WhatsApp."
>
	<main class="privacy-page">
		<div class="privacy-page__inner">
			<p class="privacy-page__eyebrow">GEA STUDIO</p>
			<h1>PRIVACY POLICY</h1>

			<section>
				<h2>1. Data controller</h2>
				<p>Gea Studio is responsible for processing the personal data you provide when you contact us.</p>
				<p>For any questions about your data, you can write to <a href="mailto:geaestudiocreativo@gmail.com">geaestudiocreativo@gmail.com</a>.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>2. How to contact us</h2>
				<p>This website does not include contact forms. You can contact Gea Studio by phone, WhatsApp, or email when you choose to use one of these channels.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>3. Data we may process</h2>
				<p>We may process the information you choose to share during the conversation, such as your name, phone number, project information, and any other data needed to answer your enquiry or prepare a quote.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>4. Purpose and legal basis</h2>
				<p>We use this data to handle your request, communicate with you, and, where applicable, manage a professional or contractual relationship. The legal basis is your consent when you initiate communication and, where appropriate, the application of pre-contractual measures or performance of a contract.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>5. Retention</h2>
				<p>We will retain the data for as long as necessary to handle your enquiry and afterwards for the periods required by applicable legal obligations. We will not retain it longer than necessary.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>6. Recipients</h2>
				<p>We do not share your data with third parties unless legally required or necessary to provide the requested service. WhatsApp is an external service and its use is also governed by its own terms and privacy policy.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>7. Your rights</h2>
				<p>You can request access, rectification, erasure, restriction, objection, or portability of your data by writing to <a href="mailto:geaestudiocreativo@gmail.com">geaestudiocreativo@gmail.com</a>. You can also lodge a complaint with the Spanish Data Protection Agency.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>8. Cookies and analytics</h2>
				<p>This website does not use its own cookies, analytics cookies, or advertising tracking tools.</p>
			</section>

			<p class="privacy-page__updated">Last updated: September 6, 2026.</p>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.privacy-page { padding: 180px 24px 120px; background: #f8f8f8; color: #1b1b1b; }
	.privacy-page__inner { width: min(100%, 760px); margin: 0 auto; }
	.privacy-page__eyebrow { margin: 0 0 28px; font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; }
	h1, h2, p { margin: 0; }
	h1 { font-family: 'Panchang', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 64px); font-weight: 400; line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: 0.01em; }
	section { margin-top: 64px; }
	h2 { font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(14px, 2.2vw, 16px); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
	section p { margin-top: 16px; font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.55; }
	a { color: inherit; }
	.privacy-page__updated { margin-top: 72px; font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 300; color: rgba(27, 27, 27, 0.58); }
	@media (max-width: 767px) { .privacy-page { padding: 136px 24px 80px; } section { margin-top: 48px; } section p { font-size: clamp(14px, 3.8vw, 16px); } }
</style>
